{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/713438-kiths-the-missing-seeming-ideas","id":713438,"title":"Kiths: The Missing Seeming Ideas","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-21T19:04:59-07:00","id":713438,"title":"Kiths: The Missing Seeming Ideas","content":"So we've got a pretty good list of the Kiths so far located here: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mZpz1PhV2jzc2ihda1IwHZc_WTrWTv5qbNv4vzcU2-4/preview?pli=1\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1.../preview?pli=1</a><br /> <br /> <br /> But as you'll probably notice, we only get 3 examples of Seemings for each of the Kiths. So I figured why don't we post our own ideas for how the Seemings not included in the preview could be encountered or interpreted in the game?<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Tunnelgrub (Elemental):</b> A humanoid skeleton floating within a quivering, gelatinous ooze.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Waterborn (Wizened):</b> A deep sea diving suit with a pair of brightly glowing eyes shining within the helmet like searchlights.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Woodwalker (Fairest):</b> A forest nymph with pale green skin and hair the color of Autumn leaves. A network of tattoos spans her body, resembling creeping vines.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Snowskin (Ogre):</b> A frost giant in the form of a hulking man with icy blue skin and braided hair as white as the snow.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Razorhand (Fairest):</b> A wandering Ronin dressed in pristine robes and who is never seen without his favorite sword within arm's reach. His demeanor is often solemn with memories of the lives he has taken.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Polychromatic (Ogre):</b> Their skin has been transformed into prismatic armor, their Keeper having embedded color shifting stones of various sizes and shapes into its surface.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T04:39:53-07:00","id":714152,"title":"","content":"Cool idea.<br /> <br /> Iles- Orge-Princess Fiona from the Shrek movies<br /> <br /> Antiqutian-wizen- You look like you where miss matching equiptment and clothes from different eras in history,a Spartan helmet over your head, breast plate from the middle ages, pants from the USA civil war, a shing gaunlet of a conquistidor on one hand, and the work glove of an African America Slave replacing the other hand for example.<br /> <br /> Nix-Orger-You look like a vaguely humaniod Kraken.<br /> <br /> Grimlin-Fairest-you look like Gizmo from the Grimlin movies-Darkling you look like the Grimlins from the Grimlins movie.<br /> <br /> Orge Tunnelgrub- You look like a giant humaniod maggot, with ripped muscles.<br /> <br /> Orge Flowering- Humaniod Corpse Flower or Giant Man Eating Venus Fly Trap.<br /> <br /> Draconic Darkling- Like Black Dragon out of D&amp;D.<br /> <br /> Blightbent Fairest- Your so beautiful you just seem to have glow about you, literally, a radioactive glow.<br /> <br /> Witchtooth-Elemental-an element of pure magic, your covered in magical symbols and your body glows with magic, your surround by magical spackles, wizen-You have a crystal skull for a head, your fingers are magic wands that bend, you fat belly has been replaced by a crystal ball, and your legs have been replaced by scrolls of magic laced together.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T05:14:57-07:00","id":714215,"title":"","content":"I love it! Good initiative.<br /> <br /> <b>Bright One (Wizened):</b> Here comes the one who seems to have fused with a Christmas tree: he seems all lightbulb, flashlight and fairy lights.<br /> <br /> <b>Gravewright (Beast):</b> A jackal or vulture headed being whose body is a covered by a mishmash of black fur and grey feather.<br /> <br /> <b>Mirrorskin (Elemental):</b> A wax like figure with features who begin to melt when temperature is rising.<br /> <br /> <b>Oracle (Fairest):</b> She is a beautiful elf-like individual who seems to exist a little out-of-time: she begins to speak a second after her lips have started to move and her shadow is always a little late when it comes to sync with her body.<br /> <br /> <b>Skogsra (Beast):</b> Is it the fox tail, the ram who sprouted from his head, the hoofed feet, the bear-like paws or the eyes who would obviously are more in place on an own head?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":822,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/822-daemonchrno","user":"DaemonChrno","date":". 10-22-2015, 11:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/822-daemonchrno","name":"DaemonChrno","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"118"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T05:19:21-07:00","id":714219,"title":"","content":"I like the Witchtooth!<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Airtouched (Wizened):</b> Eyes placed within transparent goggles to endure strong winds, coiled springs in place of feet and leather flaps grafted to the arms and legs like a flying squirrel suit.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Artist (Elemental):</b> A human shaped easel with a skin of plastic covered with pockets of water colored paints and fingers carved of flexible wood ending with finely woven bristles.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Blightbent (Beast):</b> A man sized cockroach standing on its hind legs. They would find a stroll through Chernobyl quite peaceful!<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Bloodbrute (Wizened):</b> An amputee who's hands have been surgically replaced with spiked cestuses, flexing with the help of mechanical implants. A cybernetic left eye to monitor the flow of battle, with a torso perpetually wrapped in bandages. Their legs stand upon reinforced metal hooks instead of human feet.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Palewraith (Ogre):</b> An elongated, three dimensional shadow looming over you with glowing red eyes on an otherwise blank face.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 10-22-2015, 11:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T16:50:55-07:00","id":716242,"title":"","content":"Artist Fairest-She looks like someone used her beautiful body as a canvass, every inch of her body looks like its been finger painted with a dazzling array of colours and patterns.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T17:01:44-07:00","id":716280,"title":"","content":"Gravewright Elemental- You look like human shaped tombstone, including RIP and your name engraved into your chest.<br /> <br /> Dancer-Darkling- She never dances alone, her 3 dimesional shadow always dances with her, some times her shadow is even male.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T17:30:48-07:00","id":716347,"title":"","content":"Jewel Eye Darkling - His eyes are made from the finest Onyx, they seem to almost drew the light into them.<br /> <br /> Fairest - Made from the finest metals Fae verisons of Gold, Silver, Platium, but far tougher then any earthly equivilant.<br /> <br /> Fairest Telluric- Orion Slavegirls/Males<br /> <br /> Fairest Author- Wow he looks like he's right off the cover of a romance novel but where the fuck is the breeze blowing his hair coming from.<br /> <br /> Whisperwisp- Call 1-800-HOT-TITS, its free and discreet, this Whisperwisp looks the girls in the phone sex ads, except she's always wearinga strange exotic looking bluetooth or cell phone that never leaves her person. When using her ability to take at a distance someone always finds a strange cellphone on thier person, that disappears when the call is over. Her voice always seems oversexualized, even inapproately so at times.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T23:58:35-07:00","id":717689,"title":"","content":"<b>Bloodbrute (Fairest):</b> He looks like a viking plucked from the middle ages, sporting a Fabio haircut and muscular physique. At times, you can swear his eyes shine when engaged in battle!<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Broadback (Fairest):</b> The body of a gold metal Olympian or a circus performer, they look like they could easily break the world record for weight lifting if they weren't afraid of drawing attention to themselves.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Chimera (Ogre):</b> A hideously deformed creature with hulking muscles. Its gaze can barely contain the fury it holds for what it has become.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Draconic (Ogre): </b>A body covered in ebony black scales, glowing magma courses through their veins. It's head is reptilian with sharp teeth and frilled ears.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Flowering (Ogre):</b> A carnivorous plant that somehow obtained mobility. A perfectly circular mouth drips with sweet smelling drool surrounded by enticing flower petals. It's squat body is a bloated stem which shambles along on leg shaped roots and snatches prey with leafy arms!<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Gargantuan (Beast):</b> A dire animal who is nearly three times as large as its species should naturally grow. (i.e cats the size of children, dogs the size of a man, rabbits that stand knee high.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-06T19:24:23-08:00","id":781487,"title":"","content":"Gameplayer (Beast): A blocky horse head resembling that of a knight chess piece. A beast with a checkerboard pattern in his fur. A cat-woman with slit pupil eyes that make you think of a pair of dice that came up 2 and 3, who always seems to be shuffling cards with a grin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10118-bronzedog","name":"BronzeDog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"239"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T16:35:26-08:00","id":783741,"title":"","content":"Based on a few NPC's in my game:<br /> <br /> Polychromatic Darkling: Made entirely of Obsidian, with a mesmerizing rainbow that seems to dance beneath the surface, showing itself when the light catches them just right.<br /> <br /> Fireheart Ogre: A Fire Giant, straight out of Norse Mythology.<br /> <br /> Palewraith Darkling (How is this not in the samples?): A creature of coalesced shadow that seems to suck the light and color out of their surroundings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2283-andreamus","name":"andreamus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2283_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-03T18:47:16-08:00","id":822947,"title":"","content":"<b>Ifrit (Fairest):</b> A hauntingly beautiful woman made of flames inside an volcanic exoskeleton.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Ifrit (Wizened): </b>A flame retarded suit and gas mask worn over a humanoid figure with a fuel pack and flame throwers permanently strapped to their body.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Illes (Beast):</b> At night, he seems like a well groomed, protective dog of indeterminate breed. The touch of sunlight reveals him for the mangy, foaming mutt he truly is.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Larcenist (Ogre):</b> A horrid figure who's body possesses more joints and proportions than is natural, allowing them to perform impossible feats of dexterity or slight of hand.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Leechfinger (Ogre):</b> An obese man with pale skin and multiple razor toothed mouths on their palms and finger tips.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Nix (Beast): </b>A bipedal fish with needle sharp teeth, milky white eyes and scales the color of dried blood. A fluorescent antenna grows from their forehead, producing an almost hypnotic glow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 02-03-2016, 09:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-03T20:46:00-08:00","id":823031,"title":"","content":"Nice ideas people!<br /> <br /> <b>Truefriend (</b><b>Wizened</b><b>): </b>He looks like a patchwork stuffed animal, something made to comfort children. He probably has button or glass eyes, fur all over his body, and a kind smile of stitches.<br /> <br /> <b>Telluric (Darkling): </b>A mass of stars and shadows. At night, she seems to blend in with the sky, talking to it, or maybe <i>being</i> it.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10751-belac93","name":"Belac93","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10751_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-04T00:45:54-08:00","id":823140,"title":"","content":"Interesting ideas all around; let me throw mine into the fray.<br /> <br /> <b>Author (Beast):</b> His fingers end in fountain pen nibs just as ball point horns decorate his head, each of them ready to ooze color. Scales are inked onto his body, some not even dry, and his eyes are pools of a deep hued ink.<br /> <br /> <b>Blightbent (Fairest):</b> Like a movie star from the black and white era, her fingers, lips and hair tinted black. Her skin has an unnatural yellow tinge, but it's hard to notice when she seductively blows out a ring of smoke<br /> <br /> <b>Chimera (Ogre):</b> A huge figure with puffy black skin, a mass of limp tentacles on his head for hair and holes on the back half of his body that breath out a musky fog.<br /> <br /> <b>Render (Fairest):</b> A figure whose curves are accented with blades, from her fingers to her hips to her hair, all angled to catch the light perfectly, even as she swings for your neck.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-09T18:58:47-08:00","id":827259,"title":"","content":"(This one doesn't have any Seeming yet, but I really wanted to write it up)<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Beast:</b> At first glance, you mistake the chocolate brown to be the color of her fur, until you get closer and realize she is actually made out of chocolate sculpted into the form of an anthropomorphic bunny. Rich caramel flows through her veins while the scent of dark chocolate wafts off her like a perfume. A chunk of her right ear is missing, with teeth marks indicating it was bitten off by an unknown assailant.<br /> <br /> <br /> ----------------------------<br /> <br /> <b>True Friend (Wizened):</b> He used to spend hours riding around on his Keeper's shoulder, parroting his master's ideas and otherwise serving as a Yes Man to feed their ego. The metal collar and broken chain is still worn around his neck, a permanent reminder of his service. He has the body of a green skinned imp with a lithe, almost child-like body. Bright red horns grow from his scalp, and he has a prehensile tail that ends in an arrow head. The tiny wings growing from his back once offered him the power of flight, but are too small and weak in the normal world to be of much use anymore.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Troll (Fairest):</b> A knight clad in dark armor standing firm with a posture that dares anyone to cross the line they have drawn in the sand.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Skogsra (Elemental):</b> With its wooden skin and thin frame, it appears to be fashioned together of wooden sticks and could easily vanish into the foliage if you take your eyes off them!<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Skitterskulk (Ogre): </b>Wicked claws like a grappling hook and powerful leg muscles to propel itself upward. The lumbering creature scaled cliffs through shear strength, rather than graceful agility.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 06-28-2016, 09:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-15T20:37:51-08:00","id":830762,"title":"","content":"Truefriend (Darkling): A figure with dusky red skin and delicate horns whose smile invites trust even as his calculating eyes assess you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-15T21:27:01-08:00","id":830797,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HobbitGuy1420</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/713438-kiths-the-missing-seeming-ideas?p=830762#post830762\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Truefriend (Darkling): A figure with dusky red skin and delicate horns whose smile invites trust even as his calculating eyes assess you.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd much prefer something like an old, faded toy, something ugly-cute, or an ornery nightly pet. But that's just me. I don't think &quot;calculating&quot; is a terribly good fit for a Truefriend.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/872434-shadow-knight-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","name":"ShadowKnight1224","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"975"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T05:12:48-08:00","id":831674,"title":"","content":"The idea was of the traditional devil, the creature you probably *shouldn't* trust, but do. I'm not tied to it, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-26T19:07:52-08:00","id":837864,"title":"","content":"Deartheart Beast-A Satyr<br /> Dearheart Elemental- an Apsara<br /> <br /> Darkling Soldier- Weapons always cast a long shadow.<br /> <br /> Darkling Flamesiren- glowing embers cover his/her body in a mezmorizing and enticing pattern.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-17T13:47:11-07:00","id":848960,"title":"","content":"Darkling Runnerswift: Huh? He was right there!<br /> <br /> Ogre Runnerswift: Every step they take shatters the ground and throws them forward like a cannonball. You'll stay out of their way if you want to keep your skeleton intact.<br /> <br /> Alternate Elemental Runnerswift: You can only tell he's speeding by due to a thundering blur and the chaos of debris being tossed in every direction. When standing still, which is rare, he looks like someone in a video being fast-forwarded, the only distinct feature being an adrenaline-loving smile.<br /> <br /> Fairest Runnerswift: An impeccable athlete that breezes through the deadliest obstacle courses in Arcadia just as gracefully as the rooftops of the Ironside. Sometimes you can see him making dramatic poses in the middle of a risky maneuver.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-17T14:17:05-07:00","id":848982,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/713438-kiths-the-missing-seeming-ideas?p=837864#post837864\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Deartheart Beast-A Satyr<br /> Dearheart Elemental- an Apsara<br /> <br /> Darkling Soldier- Weapons always cast a long shadow.<br /> <br /> Darkling Flamesiren- glowing embers cover his/her body in a mezmorizing and enticing pattern.</div> </div> </div> </div> I think a Darkling Soldier would be closer to a shinobi or another type of assassin. A Darkling Flamesiren could be surrounded by cold ghost flames of eerie coloration.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T21:40:38-07:00","id":921846,"title":"","content":"Wizened Musician (Alternate): She looks like she was made out of a music box. Her skin looks obviously porcelain, and you can see the inner components of it from the hole in her chest, past the bronze-seeming rib-bones. The chiming of a music box can be heard when she speaks and sings.<br /> <br /> Beast Cyclopean: They look like an animal with a thick, athletic build that helps them work on whatever Craft they did, such as a bear or elephant. Whichever piece they're missing looks like it was lost in a fight, and they don't make much of an effort to cover the scars.<br /> <br /> Fairest Cleareyes: He looks like an elf straight out an anime: large almond-shaped eyes of odd colors, with pointed ears and smooth, sensitive skin.<br /> <br /> (By the way, if someone has an idea for a Wizened Cleareyes, that would be awesome to see. &gt;__&gt;)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11755-aquatica1000","name":"Aquatica1000","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11755_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-27T22:35:07-07:00","id":922468,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"